WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:07.700
Most people only pay attention to the final product of a successful entrepreneur.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.300
They say things like,

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.900
"I can never be like them.” or "They got lucky".

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.960
What most don’t see, is what they’ve overcome.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:27.210
All the struggles, the daily rejections, the
heartaches,

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:33.929
the betrayals, the rumors, the criticism,
the empty bank account and all those lonely

00:00:33.929 --> 00:00:40.399
nights while trying to make their vision a
reality.

00:00:40.399 --> 00:00:44.260
You see, the only difference between the one who quits
and the one who doesn’t, is that they

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:50.229
showed up every day,
they worked hard every day,

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.000
they hustled every day,

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.000
they learned from a proven mentor every day,

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:01.000
they improved every day.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:10.720
They did all this even though they felt like quitting every day.

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:14.370
and eventually they became who they are
today.

